{"id":1061201,"name":"玛格丽塔·审查Ⅰ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"玛格丽塔·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1061201]}],"trial":{"trial_id":61201,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2026-02-14 05:00:00","diary1":"任务途中突遭交通阻塞，街头的抗议与怒吼交织成躁动的漩涡，你看到一场由立场与身份而起的冲突正在蔓延。\n　　你清楚这不仅是一次普通的意外，而是现在席卷狄斯的理念对抗的缩影。身为MBCC的局长，你纵然明知自己力量微薄，又岂能袖手旁观。","diary2":"理智与情绪濒临崩塌之际，玛格丽塔款步而来，轻声细语，却掌控全场。她不靠力量，却以语言缝合裂隙；不动用权威，却让众声归于平静。\n　　但和平的表象之下，却仍有风云变幻。你奉命审查处境微妙的玛格丽塔。也成了她与狄斯高层博弈间唯一的变量。你该怎么做？又能怎么做？","evidence":[{"ID":260875,"Num":1},{"ID":260877,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260876,"Num":1},{"ID":260878,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":3,"dialogue_id":161201019,"next":[20]},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161201022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_